  "prefLabel": "Cub 310.01 Appeal of Current Use Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cub 310.01 Appeal of Current Use Application. If the municipal assessing officials deny in whole or in part any application for current use assessment, the applicant may appeal pursuant to RSA 79-A:9, RSA 79-A:11, and Cub 302.05.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cub 300) #12857-B, eff 8-23-19",
